{"schema_version":2,"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","events":[],"persons":[{"id":"dongyuan-p0191","name":"匈奴单于（高幹求援）","evidence":["dongyuan-q-o066"],"facts":[],"aliases":[],"mentions":[{"id":"dongyuan-m-o066-dongyuan-p0191","kind":"mention","text":"文中提及","evidence":["dongyuan-q-o066"]}]}],"evidence":[{"id":"dongyuan-q-o066","section":"chapter-006","block":"b-c04aa2e6c942c6cf2a0e","layer":"original","quote":"高幹叛，执上党太守，举兵守壶口关。遣乐进、李典击之，未拔。十一年，太祖征幹。幹乃留其将夏昭、邓升守城，自诣匈奴单于求救，不得。独与数骑亡，欲南奔荆州，上洛都尉捕斩之。﹝一﹞","section_title":"董二袁刘传第六","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0017.xhtml","index":373,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":86,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
